<title>CANADA: Onex gets C$60 mln dividend from Vencap.</title>
<headline>Onex gets C$60 mln dividend from Vencap.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Onex Corp said on Monday that it received a C$60 million dividend from its subsidiary Vencap Equities Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;Over the past year, Vencap has been realizing value on its broadly diversified portfolio of middle-market growth companies,&quot; Onex said.</p>
<p>Onex acquired Vencap from the Alberta government in January 1996.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
